    "name": "Area 75",
    "steam_appid": 3618330,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618330/extras/756fd61eb062fb0b3e6afb7dfa00d075.avif?t=1743738009\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >We are members of an elite special forces unit known as the Night Owls. We are being sent to a secret military laboratory where they are experimenting with dark matter. Our main mission will be to extract highly classified data from Sector 21, as for some reason their transfer has been interrupted. One of the other main orders is to clear the path there, as chaos has completely broken out in some sectors. We join the story from Rick Gerrison's perspective.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Take down the terror and save the Humanity with the Dark Matter!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three Combat Variants:</strong> In the game, you can assemble your combat strategy from three weapon variants, as you may need everything to survive! In addition to traditional firearms, you can also take control of Hybrid Technology-equipped devices and the forces of darkness. Use them wisely, as danger lurks around every corner!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618330/extras/cecd860fb1a8d8afe03e42ff55619599.poster.avif?t=1743738009\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618330/extras/cecd860fb1a8d8afe03e42ff55619599.webm?t=1743738009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Power Abilities:</strong> Rick is the only person chosen by the dark matter. Control the dark forces with which you can unleash brutal powers, or manipulate time with that power. The decision is in your hands!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618330/extras/5c90324e629fc05387c61b9c6253bbd5.poster.avif?t=1743738009\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618330/extras/5c90324e629fc05387c61b9c6253bbd5.webm?t=1743738009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic-Evolved Combat System: </strong>Engage in raw, physical combat that combines traditional weapons and the special powers of darkness, providing you with unique abilities. Adapt to enemies and environments as you complete your mission. Your inventory and abilities will evolve as you progress through the game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618330/extras/d3775d3994566932e048e356bce8207a.poster.avif?t=1743738009\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618330/extras/d3775d3994566932e048e356bce8207a.webm?t=1743738009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Oriented Gameplay: </strong>As the story progresses, you'll uncover the secrets of the abandoned laboratory and the dark matter that permeates spacetime, while your companions provide you with crucial information via radio to aid your navigation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>+ Exclusive Story Experience:</strong> The game is originally equipped with Hungarian voice acting and English subtitles. Immerse yourself in this horrific story, which the wonderful Hungarian voice acting makes even more mysterious and atmospheric for you. A unique gaming experience is guaranteed!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618330/extras/7bd5f81802aac425a9c1ff8f4bd5cca9.poster.avif?t=1743738009\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618330/extras/7bd5f81802aac425a9c1ff8f4bd5cca9.webm?t=1743738009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Survival Gameplay:</strong> You must scavenge for weapons, resources, and equipment in a laboratory where every shadow hides danger. Face increasingly terrifying monsters and uncover the secrets of the lab while fighting for survival.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618330/extras/47bb1f1d800682594979227b4a88dbc1.poster.avif?t=1743738009\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618330/extras/47bb1f1d800682594979227b4a88dbc1.webm?t=1743738009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over-the-shoulder Camera:</strong> The fixed-camera viewpoints to an over-the-shoulder perspective, putting you closer to what Rick sees, for a more thrilling, more immersive experience as you explore the Labor and come face-to-face with monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618330/extras/599a58543fd2ec6ba7c24c7cb13fadd8.poster.avif?t=1743738009\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618330/extras/599a58543fd2ec6ba7c24c7cb13fadd8.webm?t=1743738009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-time attacks: </strong>Whatever you do, don\u2019t drop your guard. Everything takes place in real-time. That means any action you take, whether it be reloading or digging through your inventory, gives the monsters a perfect opportunity to attack. This nightmare has just begun and it\u2019s up to get to the bottom of what happened here.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618330/extras/9cdfb1e6d8a6fc6384322a4fd61ccc88.poster.avif?t=1743738009\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618330/extras/9cdfb1e6d8a6fc6384322a4fd61ccc88.webm?t=1743738009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready for this mission? Humanity is counting on you!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
